// Application icon for turbo-winfare.exe.
//
// Explorer, the taskbar and the Alt-Tab list pick the icon resource with the LOWEST numeric
// ID, so this is a bare 1 rather than a named constant -- IDI_ICON1 is a Visual Studio
// resource.h convention and is not defined by MinGW's windows.h.
//
// The .ico path is resolved against windres' include path, which CMakeLists.txt points at
// this directory. Regenerate the .ico with tools/make_icon.ps1 if the logo changes.
1 ICON "turbo-winfare.ico"
